# SNI candidates for REALITY fitness testing.
# Format: one hostname per line. Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored.
# Test with: ngray sni test   /   ngray sni discover
#
# Good REALITY SNI: TLS1.3 + h2 ALPN + X25519 + non-redirect + IP near VPS.
#
# Protocol notes:
#   REALITY+Vision  — any OK SNI; prefer IP geographically near VPS
#   XHTTP           — must be Cloudflare or Fastly CDN (no h2 stream rate-limiting)
#                     Best: pypi.org, npmjs.com, jsdelivr.net, cdnjs.com
#                     Avoid Google domains (aggressive rate-limiting on chunked h2)
#   AnyTLS / TUIC   — any OK SNI; REALITY keypair authenticates, SNI is cosmetic

# ── Blackout survivors (allowlisted by Iran even during a national shutdown) ─
# Jan 2026 shutdown ran a protocol+SNI allowlist: only HTTPS to an explicit set
# of domains crossed (Google, GitHub, Apple, Samsung, Microsoft, ChatGPT/OpenAI…).
# REALITY survives a blackout only when its SNI is one of these. All verified
# REALITY-fit (TLS1.3 + h2 + X25519); Bing/PlayStation/play.google.com are NOT.
chatgpt.com
openai.com
api.openai.com
apps.apple.com

# ── Cloudflare CDN (best for XHTTP; global, reliable h2, no rate-limiting) ──
pypi.org
npmjs.com
registry.npmjs.org
jsdelivr.net
cdnjs.com
jquery.com
react.dev
unpkg.com
cloudflare.com
workers.dev
pages.dev
dash.cloudflare.com
jsdelivr.com

